<file path="index.md">
---
layout: default
title: Home
---

# Welcome to our blog!

We are so glad you are here. This space is currently under active development as we build out a completely custom, scratch-built experience from the ground up. 

We are hard at work designing our layouts and getting everything set up behind the scenes. We can't wait to share our stories, ideas, and updates with you very soon!

Stay tuned for our first posts.
</file>

<file path="_layouts/default.html">
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{ page.title }} | {{ site.title }}</title>
  <!-- This magic tag injects all your SEO-tag plugin data for Google -->
  {% seo %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/style.css' | relative_url }}">
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ '/assets/images/favicon-32x32.png' | relative_url }}" type="image/png" sizes="32x32">
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <a href="/" class="site-logo">
        <img src="{{'/assets/images/logo-short.png' | relative_url}}" alt="{{ site.title }} logo">
    </a>
    <nav>
      <a href="{{ '/' | relative_url }}">Home</a>
      <a href="https://treachtheword.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Store</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Jekyll automatically injects your page content right here -->
    {{ content }}
  </main>

  <footer>
    {% assign start_year = 2026 %}
    {% assign current_year = 'now' | date: "%Y" | plus: 0 %}
    &copy; {% if current_year > start_year %}{{ start_year }}&ndash;{{ current_year }}{% else %}{{ start_year }}{% endif %} {{ site.author.name }} &mdash; {{ site.tagline }}
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
